{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1b9c1cdd-3075-8329-8a55-1be8f5e2b1eb",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T10:26:48-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sarah Okafor",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:22:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:22:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I need to report a pothole. It's a bad one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:22:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing, I can take that. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:22:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "145 Gidley Street. In front of the house, basically. Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:22:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "145 Gidley, okay. And how big are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:23:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Deep. It'd swallow a tire. I'm not exaggerating. Whole wheel goes down in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:23:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow, okay. Is it out in the travel lane, or over by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:23:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in the bike lane. That's what bugs me. Somebody on a bike hits that, they're over the handlebars."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:23:29-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's no good. Okay, I'm writing this down. Pothole, 145 Gidley Street, deep, in the bike lane. [pause] Has it been there a while, or did it just show up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:23:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's been getting worse for weeks. I figured somebody would've seen it by now. Nobody has."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:23:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understandable. I don't see a report on it yet, so I'll get this one in the system today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:24:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Sorry, hold on. [pause] I'm stretching the phone cord across the kitchen, trying to see out the window. Okay. Yes, it's still there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:24:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A corded phone, I respect it. Can you see how far it is from the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:24:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Couple feet. Maybe three. Right where the bike lane stripe is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:24:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Couple feet off the curb, on the stripe. Anything around it, like cracking or a patch that came apart?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:24:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cracked all around the edge. Looks like an old patch gave out. Pieces of asphalt all over the lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:24:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, old patch failed, debris in the bike lane. That helps the crew know what they're dealing with."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:25:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How long do repairs usually take? Ballpark."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:25:08-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually somewhere between a few days and a couple weeks, depending on how backed up the crews are. This time of year, cold patch is what they use, and the holidays slow things down some."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:25:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple weeks. With a hole like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:25:31-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll flag it as deep and in the bike lane, so it gets looked at sooner rather than later. That's the best I can do from my end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:25:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Please do. Somebody's going to get hurt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:25:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll make a note of the safety concern. Do you want a call back when it's done, or just leave it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call me back if there's a problem or they need more. Number's 401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-three. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sarah Okafor. O-K-A-F-O-R."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okafor, got it. Okay Sarah, so that's a deep pothole at 145 Gidley, in the bike lane, old patch failed, loose asphalt around it. Sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All set. It's in. Anything else I can help with this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling, Sarah. Have a good week."
    }
  ],
